      "status": "candidate",
      "text": "SilverBall Mania (Bally 1978)\noriginally modded from a 32assassin beta table in 2016\nAugust 2021 rebuild\nHauntFreaks - v1.0 - rebuilt layout, PF modded to fit layout, new and cleaned images, lighting, object and GI shadows\n      - v1.2 - more PF ajustments, added primitive apron, rails, lockdown, added missing leaf switches\nFluffhead35 - v1.0 - Added nFozzy Flippers, targetbouncer logic, flipper Rubberizer logic, and fleep sounds\n            - v1.2 - Realligned some posts and rubbers, Added missing Rubber Wall, Changed Rubber walls to Hit Threshold of 2\n            - Added slingshot sound for Fleep to scorring Rubbers, Removed old sounds not being used anymore\n            - Added logic to swap out ball card for 3 or 5 balls per game\nEBisLIT playfield image\n*********************************************************************************************************"
    }
  ],
